TRAFFIC ADVISORY

Due to ongoing recovery operations around UBA Roundabout towards Apongbon Under Bridge, as well as the rehabilitation works on the CMS/Apongbon Bridge, traffic has been temporarily diverted.

Motorists from State House, NITEL, and CMS Bridge are advised to divert through Inner Marina via CMS Cathedral and NITEL Building to access Third Mainland Bridge.

Alternatively, motorists can use Inner Marina through Abibu Oki to connect Broad Street and exit at Apongbon Under Bridge to access Eko Bridge.

Motorists are advised to exercise patience and cooperate with traffic officials on ground.
