[5:15AM] #Island
#UBA_Roundabout
#IncidentReport

A 40ft container detached from its tractor head overnight at UBA Roundabout inward Apogbon, with the cause suspected to be a brake  failure, the body was abandoned in the middle of the roadway, hindering the free flow of traffic.
The  driver fled with the tractor head, leaving the container behind.

 Recovery operations are underway involving LASTMA Rescue Team  and other personnel around the area .
A  crane, towing vehicl  and flatbed truck en route for evacuation.
